{{!--
  A custom probe runs a release a major release or more behind the
  OneUptime it reports to (#9977; Workers Probe:NotifyMajorReleaseBehind).
  Sent once for each major release of OneUptime to the probe's owners - the
  project's owners when it has none - under their "Probe a major release
  behind" notification setting. The words are made by
  Common/Server/Utils/Probe/ProbeMajorReleaseNotification: every value is
  a plain value, escaped where it is shown, and none names the release a
  feature first shipped in - it says to update to the latest release, which
  has every feature a release has shipped. Every sentence that names the
  product names it as the installation goes by ((brandName)), so the
  builder hands the pieces and the template writes them. missedFeatures
  lists what the probe cannot do until it is updated, in the probe page's
  words; it is empty when it misses nothing a release added.
--}}
{{> Start this}}


{{> Logo this}}
{{> EmailTitle title=(concat probeName " is " majorReleasesLabel " behind " (brandName)) }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "Probe " probeName " runs " probeVersionPhrase ", " majorReleasesLabel " behind " (brandName) " " serverRelease ", which it reports to. Update it to get the latest checks and fixes.") }}

{{> InfoBlock info="Here are the details: "}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Probe Name:" plainText=probeName }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Probe Description:" plainText=probeDescription }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Probe Version:" plainText=probeRelease }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(concat (brandName) " Version:") plainText=serverRelease }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Project:" plainText=projectName }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{#if hasMissedFeatures}}
{{> TitleBlock title="Until it is updated"}}
{{#each missedFeatures}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=this }}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "Update the probe to the latest " (brandName) " release: start it again from the newest image, with the same probe ID and key.") }}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=updateProbeDocsUrl buttonText="How to Update a Probe"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=viewProbeLink linkLabel="See the probe's version and what it misses on its page:"}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "You are told once for each major release of " (brandName) " this probe falls behind.") }}

{{> OwnerInfo this }}
{{> UnsubscribeOwnerEmail this }}

{{> Footer this }}

{{> End this}}
